 ## Audit/refactor performed
 
-The audit target was the rev0691 reclaim helper. The key finding was that the row lifecycle was now safe enough to reject live steals and reclaim expired claims, but the reclaim update still erased displaced-owner details from the primary workorder row. Attempt count survived; previous owner identity and reason did not.
